{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639660/extras/Simple_Battle_2.gif?t=1744642541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fusing Battling tops and Roguelike Deckbuilding together to create an endless\u00a0\u00a0decent source of battling tops fun! Collect new tops, combine them together, pair 'em up with synergistic relic and go on a short adventure, From the Top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639660/extras/Fendry1.gif?t=1744642541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Realistic simulation-:\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong>Ready, Launch, and Battle!</strong> Use your spinning top to knock your opponents out or simply out last them in a battle of attrition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>-With a twist:</i> But these aren't your regular old battling tops, these ones have <i><strong>abilities. </strong></i>Smash at them with full force, build a wall between to defend yourself, Fly high to the sky and strike and many more abilities to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Build the perfect team:\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong>Collect</strong> new tops and <strong>Combine</strong> them together to create your perfect combination and pair them up with a suitable <strong>relic</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We start From the Top:\u00a0</i>Every time you start a new run, the layout and paths differs slightly every time. Choose paths according to your team and specialty and build the final boss fight!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639660/extras/battle3.gif?t=1744642541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From The Top Demo comes with</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 unique tops with different abilities and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 boss fights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639660?t=1744642541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639660?t=1744642541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639660/6b33c6d601b8bdcd9318f25564289dba619b45f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744642541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639660/6b33c6d601b8bdcd9318f25564289dba619b45f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744642541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The background of the story resolve around the player getting kidnapped. There will be mild comical violence protrayed, but there will not be any portrayal of real blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639660/extras/Simple_Battle_2.gif?t=1744642541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fusing Battling tops and Roguelike Deckbuilding together to create an endless\u00a0\u00a0decent source of battling tops fun! Collect new tops, combine them together, pair 'em up with synergistic relic and go on a short adventure, From the Top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639660/extras/Fendry1.gif?t=1744642541\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Realistic simulation-:\u00a0</i>\u00a0<strong>Ready, Launc